  "notSubscribed": "<div class="grid gap-3 p-3 sm:p-4"><header class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><h1 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">הודעות Messenger</h1><nav aria-label="ערוץ" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/40 border-gray-200 text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-50" href="/inbox"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block shrink-0 size-3.5" style="background-color:var(--color-success);mask-image:url(/media/social-icons/whatsapp.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(/media/social-icons/whatsapp.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain"></span>שיחות</a><a aria-current="page" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/40 border-info-border bg-primary-tint text-primary-text font-medium" href="/inbox/messenger"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block shrink-0 size-3.5" style="background-color:#0866FF;mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/sol/facebook-messenger.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/sol/facebook-messenger.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain"></span>Messenger</a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/40 border-gray-200 text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-50" href="/inbox/comments"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block shrink-0 size-3.5" style="background-color:#1877F2;mask-image:url(/media/social-icons/facebook.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(/media/social-icons/facebook.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain"></span>תגובות</a></nav></header><div class="grid gap-2"><div role="status" class="rounded-md border p-3 border-amber-300 bg-amber-50"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-amber-800">הודעות Messenger עדיין לא מגיעות לכאן</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-amber-700">פייסבוק עדיין לא שולחת ל-SocialCRM את הודעות ה-Messenger של הדף, ולכן הודעות חדשות לא יופיעו כאן.</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-amber-700">לחבר מחדש את הדף בפייסבוק. החיבור והלידים הקיימים לא ייפגעו.</p></div><div class="grid gap-2"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-solid text-white hover:bg-solid/85 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px] w-fit"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-white size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/sol/facebook.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/sol/facebook.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>חבר מחדש את הדף ל-Messenger</span></button></div></div></div>",
